/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We chose this problem because conventional farming practices often contribute to soil degradation and pollution through the heavy use of chemical fertilizers, pesticides, and intensive land cultivation. Urbanization further exacerbates these issues by reducing available arable land and increasing pollution levels.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Home Farmer is the robotic solution that we designed to revolutionize farming practices. It is capable of planting seeds, autonomously providing daily water requirements, and monitoring the environment in which the plants are growing. By incorporating sensors and sustainable farming techniques, Home Farmer optimizes resource usage and reduces reliance on harmful chemicals. The solution also reduces the human efforts for farming and makes it easily available at home.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
