/S /P
/E (The Home Farmer robot helps everyone grow fresh, healthy vegetables right at home, even in small spaces like apartments. This means people get organic, chemical-free food, reducing the need for harmful pesticides and fertilizers that damage our soil and water. By using Home Farmer, we promote healthier eating habits and protect our environment from pollution. It also encourages families and kids to learn about farming and caring for our planet. With Home Farmer, we can make our world greener and healthier, one home at a time, while making farming easy and fun for everyone!)
